<p>Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyy met British Prime Minister Keir Starmer in London on March 17, and both urged allies not to let the war in Iran overshadow Russia’s invasion of Ukraine. Starmer said international attention must stay on Ukraine, while Zelenskyy argued that Russia and Iran are linked threats and appealed for continued military and political backing for Kyiv. The London meetings also produced a new UK-Ukraine defense partnership, including British support for an AI center in Kyiv and cooperation on drones.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/Z3tGmuy9MQ9YUC9VnSsYNeONHfRQ1XaiJ6BBKDYqz0YTHRREuX--3b_PQdXaKr2YzMrZ5tS_iZiIFXtldPHM4WiKcKDDcIa0hex69SnKOzEljU52yq9kVT2xj-uC0nmnf15H6QCvxgpSDynBZLcnXxfixokTHwOcoQMiip4PWQzb7bjO1pEdi0-tExBQdl4WB5oU_lYje7zHhmEHkJUOZYipUyicGhGAIpW_ESVBlQzWoKKBSZiHHPux1g' alt='British Prime Minister Keir Starmer, Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyy and NATO Secretary General Mark Rutte meet at 10 Downing Street in London on March 17, 2026.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Drone supply deal: RFE/RL reported that the agreement reached in London was meant to strengthen supplies of drones to friendly countries.</li><li>Counter-drone pitch: Zelenskyy said the United States and other partners could use Ukraine’s anti-drone technology as the Middle East war drives demand for such systems.</li><li>Talks disrupted: Several reports said the Iran war has drained momentum from U.S.-brokered efforts to negotiate an end to Russia’s invasion of Ukraine.</li><li>Regional outreach: The London stop followed Zelenskyy’s visit to Paris last week and came ahead of a trip to Madrid on Wednesday, underscoring a broader European diplomatic push.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Volodymyr Zelenskyy: Zelenskyy cast Russia and Iran as part of the same threat environment, calling their regimes “brothers in hatred” as he urged allies not to split their focus between the two crises. (<a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/europe/article/3346941/zelensky-starmer-urge-continued-support-ukraine-iran-conflict-steals-focus'>South China Morning Post</a>)</li><li>Keir Starmer: Starmer used the London meeting to argue that allies could not let the Iran war push Ukraine off the international agenda. (<a href='https://www.dw.com/en/starmer-urges-allies-to-keep-focus-on-ukraine-amid-iran-war/a-76400266'>DW</a>)</li><li>Media analysis: Euronews highlighted an economic side effect of the Iran war, reporting that higher oil revenue has helped revive Russia’s economy even as the fighting drags on. (<a href='http://www.euronews.com/2026/03/17/starmer-says-we-cant-lose-focus-on-ukraine-amid-iran-war-during-zelenskyy-visit'>Euronews</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://japantoday.com/category/world/zelenskyy-will-discuss-russia-ukraine-war-with-british-leader-and-nato-chief-in-london'>Zelenskyy and Starmer urge continuing support for Ukraine against Russia as Iran war steals focus</a> - japantoday.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/starmer-urges-allies-to-keep-focus-on-ukraine-amid-iran-war/a-76400266'>Starmer urges allies to keep focus on Ukraine amid Iran war</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/europe/britains-starmer-tells-zelensky-focus-must-remain-on-ukraine-amid-iran-war'>Britain’s Starmer tells Zelensky ‘focus must remain on Ukraine’ amid Iran war</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.reddit.com/r/worldnews/comments/1rwpgv2/zelensky_says_regimes_in_russia_and_iran_are/'>Zelensky Says &#x27;Regimes in Russia and Iran Are Brothers in Hatred&#x27; and Urges Allies to Unite</a> - reddit.com</li><li><a href='https://www.lemonde.fr/en/international/article/2026/03/17/starmer-tells-zelensky-focus-must-remain-on-ukraine-amid-iran-war_6751538_4.html'>Starmer tells Zelensky &#x27;focus must remain on Ukraine&#x27; amid Iran war</a> - lemonde.fr</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/europe/article/3346941/zelensky-starmer-urge-continued-support-ukraine-iran-conflict-steals-focus'>Zelensky, Starmer urge continued support for Ukraine as Iran conflict steals focus</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.rferl.org/a/ukraine-zelesnskyy-russia-war-drones-iran/33709182.html'>Zelenskyy, Starmer Seek To Keep Focus On Ukraine&#x27;s Defense Against Russia As Iran War Diverts Attention</a> - rferl.org</li><li><a href='http://www.euronews.com/2026/03/17/starmer-says-we-cant-lose-focus-on-ukraine-amid-iran-war-during-zelenskyy-visit'>Starmer says &#x27;we can&#x27;t lose focus&#x27; on Ukraine amid Iran war during Zelenskyy visit</a> - euronews.com</li></ul>